 null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2454538, "client_id": 1146884, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6545cd41/uploads/origins/24a205fc-f992-4e04-b0e3-4fd4394e8305?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee0beea4f696b2838b9cec28cf54f9b8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6545cd41/uploads/origins/24a205fc-f992-4e04-b0e3-4fd4394e8305?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee0beea4f696b2838b9cec28cf54f9b8, https://si.imgix.net/6545cd41/uploads/origins/24a205fc-f992-4e04-b0e3-4fd4394e8305?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2a1ddab02d7b0abe834b8026206ddb58 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6545cd41/uploads/origins/24a205fc-f992-4e04-b0e3-4fd4394e8305?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb64881c5a40886282f71be466307602 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6545cd41/uploads/origins/24a205fc-f992-4e04-b0e3-4fd4394e8305?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a69d97bd3467c1235afc6c327600d00a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6545cd41/uploads/origins/24a205fc-f992-4e04-b0e3-4fd4394e8305?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a69d97bd3467c1235afc6c327600d00a, https://si.imgix.net/6545cd41/uploads/origins/24a205fc-f992-4e04-b0e3-4fd4394e8305?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a9cd9b0d2422c062e3ad0b4314695a3f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6545cd41/uploads/origins/24a205fc-f992-4e04-b0e3-4fd4394e8305?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=196eb6741ebed15ee1432a7696ed875c 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I really liked the drawing you did of me and my partner's characters, CARABELLE and IRENE!\nhttps://skeb.jp/@UIIU04/works/6\nIt's my favorite picture of them and I am so grateful! If possible, could I ask you to draw our other characters? Please feel free to reject or raise the price, since five characters is a lot!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/QF98bZj\n\nThey are a group of college students in a fantasy-like setting.\n- JAIME (172cm) is the green character. She is friendly, fashionable, and popular.\n- CELEUXE (165cm) is the red character. He is hot-headed, reckless, and likes to act like the leader.\n- YUMENO (157cm) is the pink character. She still acts like a \u4e2d\u4e8c\u75c5, but is nervous in public.\n- DIOE (152cm) is the yellow character. They dislike talking, but try to be polite.\n- LISZA (170cm) is the blue character. She is awkward around others, but can be playful when she feels comfortable.\n\nAll five of them are very close. Please draw however you'd like! Thank you for your consideration!", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@UIIU04/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2454538, "client_id": 350566, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2c79f4e4/uploads/origins/9796a453-5672-4571-884b-f598f0cf391c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb2f8146e2659cde1204a66829c979cc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2c79f4e4/uploads/origins/9796a453-5672-4571-884b-f598f0cf391c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb2f8146e2659cde1204a66829c979cc, https://si.imgix.net/2c79f4e4/uploads/origins/9796a453-5672-4571-884b-f598f0cf391c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c0f1f623814e10e315e5849ff5704d6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2c79f4e4/uploads/origins/9796a453-5672-4571-884b-f598f0cf391c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d2eb29ca33e68c7613badc43282efb56 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2c79f4e4/uploads/origins/9796a453-5672-4571-884b-f598f0cf391c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5b75b6d3136052074cbf8a8baeedbab3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2c79f4e4/uploads/origins/9796a453-5672-4571-884b-f598f0cf391c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5b75b6d3136052074cbf8a8baeedbab3, https://si.imgix.net/2c79f4e4/uploads/origins/9796a453-5672-4571-884b-f598f0cf391c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5228b97f307c808950bbab334f1cb214 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2c79f4e4/uploads/origins/9796a453-5672-4571-884b-f598f0cf391c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=85737b3af346f0254897c4fb8b53984e 3x"}, "body": "UI\u69d8\u3001\u306f\u3058\u3081\u307e\u3057\u3066\uff01\u30a4\u30e9\u30b9\u30c8\u3092\u697d\u3057\u304f\u62dd\u898b\u3055\u305b\u3066\u9802\u304d\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\u7d20\u6575\u306a\u7d75\u67c4\u306b\u60f9\u304b\u308c\u3066\u3001\u53ef\u80fd\u306a\u3089\u3070\u81ea\u30ad\u30e3\u30e9\u3092\u4f9d\u983c\u3057\u305f\u3044\u3068\u601d\u3063\u3066\u304a\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\n\n\u3010\u4f9d\u983c\u5185\u5bb9\u3011\n\u30ad\u30e3\u30e9\u53c2\u7167\u306f\u4e0b\u8a18\u306eURL\u3092\u3054\u89a7\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002\u5357\u6771\u30a2\u30b8\u30a2\u306e\u69d8\u306a\u30c8\u30ed\u30d4\u30ab\u30eb\u5cf6\u56fd\u306b\u65c5\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3044\u3066\u3001\u51f8\u51f9\u30b3\u30f3\u30d3\u3067\u55a7\u5629\u3059\u308c\u3070\u3059\u308b\u307b\u3069\u4ef2\u304c\u3044\u3044\u3001\u89aa\u53cb\u5bb6\u65cf\u604b\u4eba\u76f8\u68d2\u306e\u304a2\u4eba\u3067\u3059\u3002\u4e00\u7dd2\u306b\u672a\u77e5\u304b\u7981\u3058\u3089\u308c\u305f\u5ec3\u589f\u3084\u907a\u8de1\u3092\u63a2\u7d22\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3001\u6240\u8b02\u30c8\u30a5\u30fc\u30e0\u30ec\u30a4\u30c0\u30fc\u306e\u69d8\u306a\u5b58\u5728\u3067\u3059\u3002\u8910\u8272\u808c\u306e\u5b50\u306f\u697d\u5929\u5bb6\u3067\u304a\u558b\u308a\u3001\u9aea\u306e\u5185\u5074\u306f\u5b87\u5b99\u306e\u69d8\u306b\u5149\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3002\u9ed2\u9aea\u306e\u5b50\u306f\u4e0d\u5668\u7528\u3067\u30af\u30fc\u30eb\u306a\u6027\u683c\u3002\u5bfe\u7167\u7684\u306a2\u4eba\u3067\u3059\u304c\u3001\u4e00\u84ee\u6258\u751f\u306e\u4ef2\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\n\u3010\u30c6\u30fc\u30de\u3011\n\u30fb\u53ef\u80fd\u306a\u3089\u3070\u30012\u4eba\u3092\u3053\u3061\u3089\u306e\u8863\u88c5\u3092\u7740\u305b\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\uff1ahttps://sta.sh/2cqz4wti4y7\n\u27a4 \u9752\u3044\u9784\u3068\u7d2b\u306e\u30b7\u30e7\u30fc\u30eb\u304c\u4ed8\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308b\u65b9\u3092\u304a\u9858\u3044\u81f4\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u9ed2\u9aea\u306e\u5b50\u306e\u9aea\u306f\u53f3\u306b\u6d41\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3002\n\u27a4 \u3053\u306eURL\u5148\u306e\u30e2\u30c1\u30fc\u30d5\u3084\u5c0f\u7269\u3092\u5165\u308c\u3066\u3082\u5927\u4e08\u592b\u3067\u3059\uff1ahttps://sta.sh/23auuzaquab\n\n\u30fb\u30ab\u30e9\u30d5\u30eb\u3067\u53ef\u611b\u304f\u3066\u3001\u697d\u3057\u3044\u96f0\u56f2\u6c17\u306e\u4e00\u679a\u3092\u304a\u9858\u3044\u81f4\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\n\u30fb\u300c\u590f\u3001\u304a\u83d3\u5b50\u3068\u304a\u8336\u3001\u30e2\u30b6\u30a4\u30af\u30bf\u30a4\u30eb\u3001\u30f4\u30a3\u30f3\u30c6\u30fc\u30b8\u5207\u624b\u3001\u9aa8\u8463\u54c1\u3001\u592a\u967d\u3068\u6708\u3001\u6c11\u65cf\u98a8\u300d\u306e\u30e2\u30c1\u30fc\u30d5\u3092\u3069\u3061\u3089\u3067\u3082\u3054\u81ea\u7531\u306b\u4f7f\u3063\u3066\u5927\u4e08\u592b\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u30fb\u30dd\u30fc\u30ba\u3084\u69cb\u56f3\u306f\u4ed6\u306f\u4f55\u3067\u3082\u69cb\u3044\u307e\u305b\u3093\u306e\u3067\u3001\u304a\u6c17\u8efd\u306b\u63cf\u3044\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\uff01\n\n\u4f9d\u983c\u5185\u5bb9\u306b\u4f55\u304b\u96e3\u3057\u3044\u70b9\u304b\u554f\u984c\u70b9\u304c\u3042\u308c\u3070\u3001\u304a\u6c17\u306b\u306a\u3055\u3089\u305a\u3053\u306e\u4f9d\u983c\u3092\u30ad\u30e3\u30f3\u30bb\u30eb\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002\u3054\u691c\u8a0e\u306e\u307b\u3069\u3001\u4f55\u5352\u3088\u308d\u3057\u304f\u304a\u9858\u3044\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\n\nhttps://sta.sh/2cqz4wti4y7", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@UIIU04/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2454538, "client_id": 173, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0d3c4054/uploads/origins/48f9927e-9d75-48d6-996c-7311a44abfae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=958d6c5eea4a99d8d08ad9f6937778e5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0d3c4054/uploads/origins/48f9927e-9d75-48d6-996c-7311a44abfae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=958d6c5eea4a99d8d08ad9f6937778e5, https://si.imgix.net/0d3c4054/uploads/origins/48f9927e-9d75-48d6-996c-7311a44abfae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9b0313d9dd6558e25c548cc582357887 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0d3c4054/uploads/origins/48f9927e-9d75-48d6-996c-7311a44abfae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b790bde41dbbf8bfde1b7b8e2be9306a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0d3c4054/uploads/origins/48f9927e-9d75-48d6-996c-7311a44abfae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=579a1379abccadaab8a576beff500164", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0d3c4054/uploads/origins/48f9927e-9d75-48d6-996c-7311a44abfae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=579a1379abccadaab8a576beff500164, https://si.imgix.net/0d3c4054/uploads/origins/48f9927e-9d75-48d6-996c-7311a44abfae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=87684a3a4e731c1a6c97feedb0574317 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0d3c4054/uploads/origins/48f9927e-9d75-48d6-996c-7311a44abfae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=aca6fb6596e1646aa5d0dfb666395a0d 3x"}, "body": "HELLO!\n\ud83d\ude0dYour art is incredible!\nThe colors are so pretty! Everything is so fun! \nYour art makes me so happy!\ud83e\udd70\nI would be so happy if I can request a picture!\n\nCan you please draw my character?\n\ud83d\udda4His name is \u30af\u30ed\u30cb\n\nHe is an oni!\nOnce a superhero who fought evil!\nHowever, they were devoured & eaten alive by \u30e4\u30de\u30bf\u30ce\u30aa\u30ed\u30c1.\nHundreds of years later he escaped. The incident was so traumatic it changed him.\nFilled with anger & sorrow, he is now a supervillain!\nHe has many scars now. Tail & one horn damaged too.\n\nHe is also a Visual-Kei musician.\ud83c\udfa4\nHe channels his hatred & need for revenge into music.\nThe concerts have a horror theme to them! Channeling the forces of hell into his musical theater!\nA love for gothic & dark imagery!\ud83d\udc80\ud83e\udd40\nWhen he isn't performing a concert, he tends to be brooding & melancholic.\n\nHe has different outfits. You can choose the one you want to draw! Or design one for him.\nThe pose, expression, & everything I leave up to you!\nI hope you can have fun with it!\ud83d\ude04\n\nThank you!\ud83c\udf39\n\nhttps://catbox.moe/c/k6soi6", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@UIIU04/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2454538, "client_id": 2413119, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/67629a83/uploads/origins/a6250776-70ad-4a09-a5e8-97afa6f1a668?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d94f0d0dc18d316fd7913a87ab1dc68", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/67629a83/uploads/origins/a6250776-70ad-4a09-a5e8-97afa6f1a668?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d94f0d0dc18d316fd7913a87ab1dc68, https://si.imgix.net/67629a83/uploads/origins/a6250776-70ad-4a09-a5e8-97afa6f1a668?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a326e5e796a8531b234bcdd9dffa1049 2x, https://si.imgix.net/67629a83/uploads/origins/a6250776-70ad-4a09-a5e8-97afa6f1a668?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9b0f9964fbf6d459b817f09825bee813 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/67629a83/uploads/origins/a6250776-70ad-4a09-a5e8-97afa6f1a668?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b26c2fc2bccb4d919f31aa5858908bab", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/67629a83/uploads/origins/a6250776-70ad-4a09-a5e8-97afa6f1a668?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b26c2fc2bccb4d919f31aa5858908bab, https://si.imgix.net/67629a83/uploads/origins/a6250776-70ad-4a09-a5e8-97afa6f1a668?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8fbd24bfb984263a0faed002c0c9eed2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/67629a83/uploads/origins/a6250776-70ad-4a09-a5e8-97afa6f1a668?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=656b352d987efa7d814a54494f443050 3x"}, "body": "Hello! Your art style is so pretty! Would it be possible for me to request these two characters to be drawn together?\n\nCARABELLE is on the left. She is very sociable and stylish, always being recognized because she is a popular fashion designer. She is often tipsy because she drinks alcohol in order to get inspiration.\n\nIRENE is on the right. She is more serious and strict. She worked as a child actor and now dislikes a lot of the attention. Still, when she's around some of her closer friends (like CARABELLE), she lets herself smile and be a little lighter.\n\nThe two of them are close partners both on and off of work. They run the public relations division for their company. They can be drawn with alcohol, ice cream, coffee, or with newspapers and reports. These are just suggestions, please draw them however you would like! Thank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1YveyxZwQS9v9p5zU_58UzX8RMOiVv1TO/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@UIIU04/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2454538, "client_id": 3116091, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4e297374/uploads/origins/0d533bea-ab74-4fe9-9d83-b9ffe8fea389?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a3f7e2c6b39de67472ce5c53e196e9a3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4e297374/uploads/origins/0d533bea-ab74-4fe9-9d83-b9ffe8fea389?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a3f7e2c6b39de67472ce5c53e196e9a3, https://si.imgix.net/4e297374/uploads/origins/0d533bea-ab74-4fe9-9d83-b9ffe8fea389?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3ac75c48985523fe90e88b06de330e56 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4e297374/uploads/origins/0d533bea-ab74-4fe9-9d83-b9ffe8fea389?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c45abe02aa9d00ed309ec9ec75e82dd3 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4e297374/uploads/origins/0d533bea-ab74-4fe9-9d83-b9ffe8fea389?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4d84222dcfb862fdf16d04647f2b56f7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4e297374/uploads/origins/0d533bea-ab74-4fe9-9d83-b9ffe8fea389?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=